WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:17.809
Safety advocates had

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.102
the potentially hazardous

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:20.729
playground equipment removed.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:22.105
A spokesperson stated that

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:23.273
“We’ll use every tool in

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.274
the sandbox to make

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:26.234
sure our kids are safe.” 

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:36.286
The makers of

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.454
Johnny’s Li’l Blaster

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:38.538
have issued a recall

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.248
because the plastic projectiles

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:41.791
could be a choking hazard

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:43.043
for small children.

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:41.953
Large amounts of

00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:42.912
dihydrogen monoxide 

00:02:42.912 --> 00:02:43.997
have been found in public pools

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:45.165
throughout the area.

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:46.332
We’ve assembled a task force...

00:02:54.215 --> 00:02:56.050
Say adios to your salsa!

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:57.302
The FDA has recalled 

00:02:57.302 --> 00:02:58.386
the vegetable after a local

00:02:58.386 --> 00:03:00.305
outbreak of tomato pox.

00:03:00.305 --> 00:03:01.723
Want sauce on your pizza?

00:03:01.723 --> 00:03:03.016
V8 in your Bloody Mary?

00:03:15.737 --> 00:03:17.113
The city council immediately

00:03:17.113 --> 00:03:18.198
banned the use of

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:19.532
motorized scooters after

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.659
 a woman sprained her ankle.

00:03:21.659 --> 00:03:23.036
[Councilman] We take safety very

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.621
seriously in this city and

00:03:24.621 --> 00:03:25.622
we won’t stand for having a

00:03:25.622 --> 00:03:26.664
dangerous product like this

00:03:26.664 --> 00:03:27.582
out on the streets.

00:03:27.582 --> 00:03:30.043
Where average, everyday citizens

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:32.295
could be hurt or victimized

00:03:32.295 --> 00:03:34.255
by somebody who thinks it’s fun

00:03:34.255 --> 00:03:35.924
to have these products and

00:03:35.924 --> 00:03:37.967
whiz around all over the place.

00:04:57.255 --> 00:04:58.673
Hey!

00:05:00.008 --> 00:05:02.802
Second Amendment!

